WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.911
The year 2045. Genesis brings you back to the
colony.

2
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:10.429
You're back! What happened? Did we do it?

3
00:00:11.479 --> 00:00:12.603
No… right?

4
00:00:12.623 --> 00:00:15.041
I tried. But it wasn't enough.

5
00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:22.108
You came back, but the records didn't change.
Genesis has no energy left to go back.

6
00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:41.403
Alert! The Earth's atmosphere is in a critical
state!

7
00:00:43.183 --> 00:00:47.133
A chain of environmental catastrophes is
unleashed across the planet.

8
00:01:13.183 --> 00:01:14.498
It was our home…

9
00:01:14.898 --> 00:01:16.572
We had so many chances…

10
00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:23.250
Killa's notebook is still in the archive. The
last page says the same thing.

11
00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:27.038
If they were watching, why didn't anyone come
to tell us?

12
00:01:28.217 --> 00:01:31.234
The future we tried to prevent became our last
reality.

13
00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:40.178
But this is a story. Out here, it's still
today. The data exists, and someone has to

14
00:01:40.198 --> 00:01:44.279
read it in time, check it, and go out and warn
people.

15
00:01:44.679 --> 00:01:48.990
The future is not written. But every decision
leaves a mark.
